&lt;p&gt;Our modern logistics and fulfillment engine helps businesses to build and scale high-quality, personalized direct mail programs without the operational burden. As we grow to meet the evolving needs of our customers and expand our product offerings, we’re building a team to shape the future of direct mail.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Business Operations Manager&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Lob, you&#39;ll own the cross-functional programs that make or break how the company actually runs — the initiatives that span Finance, Product, Engineering, Legal, our Print &amp;amp; Delivery Network, and Go-to-Market, and that stall when no single person is accountable for finishing them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll take a program from an ambiguous problem to a documented, measured process with a named owner. You&#39;ll do the analysis, coordinate across teams that don&#39;t report to you, and deliver the executive communication required to get things done.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Business Operations Manager, you&#39;ll…&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Program Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Run three to five concurrent cross-functional programs at once, each with a defined end state, a published status, named dependency owners, and a target completion date.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Outcomes Across Teams:&lt;/strong&gt; Push programs to completion through Product, Engineering, Legal, Security, Partner Operations, Solutions, and Go-to-Market — and escalate with judgment when a dependency stalls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diagnose &amp;amp; Redesign Workflows:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify operational workflows spanning multiple teams and systems, quantify the cost of the current state, and design and implement the consolidated or automated replacement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver the Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Produce the analysis behind program decisions using Lob&#39;s data and reporting stack and available AI tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hand Off What You Build:&lt;/strong&gt; Document each program on completion and transition it to a permanent owner outside this role, with a metric that survives the handoff.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communicate to Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Prepare and deliver program reviews and status updates for the leadership team, including recommendations and the reasoning behind them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cover the Gaps:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide backup for FP&amp;amp;A, Deal Desk, and Business Operations analytics deliverables, and support planning and execution of company-wide operating cadences like QBRs and leadership offsites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What will you bring to this role…&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Management Chops:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong skills scoping ambiguous work, sequencing dependencies, and holding owners to dates across multiple organizations at once — you deliver outcomes through people who don&#39;t report to you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent verbal and written communication. You can present to and hold a position with a leadership team, and you&#39;re equally willing to do the unglamorous recurring work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Rigor:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluency sufficient to reach a defensible number independently, with healthy skepticism toward convenient ones. Familiarity with BI/data warehouse tooling and AI-assisted analysis expected; SQL helpful but not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Self-Direction:&lt;/strong&gt; Curiosity and initiative — you identify work that hasn&#39;t been assigned and go pursue it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfort with Ambiguity:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to operate well in a fast-paced environment with shifting priorities and incomplete information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relevant Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 4-7+ years post-undergrad in management consulting/corporate strategy (client-facing, multi-stakeholder delivery) or business operations, strategic finance, revenue operations, or chief-of-staff work with direct ownership of an operationally complex domain. Bachelor&#39;s degree required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Track Record:&lt;/strong&gt; A demonstrated cross-functional outcome with a measurable result — you can speak specifically to what was broken, what changed, who had to agree, and what improved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Fit (preferred):&lt;/strong&gt; Background in B2B SaaS, marketplace, logistics, or another operationally intensive business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
